    "ticket": {
      "ref": "#9",
      "title": "Projects pages (/projects index + /projects/[slug] detail)",
      "body": "## Goal\n\nAdd the projects routes to buildstacks.dev per `docs/design/buildstacks-design-spec.md` §3, §5 and §11 step 6.\n\n## Context\n\nThe `projects` content collection already exists in `src/content/config.ts` with\ntwo entries (`operon`, `responsible-citizen`), seeded by #4. The Base layout,\nHeader, Footer, BaseHead, and design tokens are all in place from #2.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] AC1: `/projects` renders an index of project cards from the `projects` collection, matching the prototype's card aesthetic.\n- [ ] AC2: `/projects/[slug]` renders a project detail page with the project body and an outbound GitHub CTA.\n- [ ] AC3: Both routes are fully static and ship zero client JavaScript.\n- [ ] AC4: A named behavior test asserts the index lists every collection entry and that a detail page renders its title and GitHub link.\n- [ ] AC5: `pnpm lint` (astro check) stays at 0 errors.\n\n## Notes\n\nReuse `ProjectCard.astro`. Do not modify the blog routes.\n",
      "labels": [
        "op:ready",
        "p1"
      ],
